# Bridge Rules

**Anchor Desk** — React/TS customer service dashboard. Bridge Systems product.

## Workflow
PREP → BUILD → VERIFY. Plan before code. Typecheck and test after.

## Code
- Root-cause fixes only. No symptom patches.
- No silent catches. Log, rethrow, or handle.
- Match existing patterns.

## UI
LIGHT-FIRST. Apple + SpaceX.

| Token       | Value     |
|-------------|-----------|
| canvas      | #F5F5F7   |
| text        | #1D1D1F   |
| primary     | #0071E3   |
| chrome      | #111111   |
| destructive | #E82127   |

Fonts: SF Pro / -apple-system, Space Grotesk headlines, JetBrains Mono data.

Retired: dark-first, #7C3AED — unless spec names them.

## Boundaries
No merge. No deploy. No secrets. No real customer data.
